flowchart LR
  classDef client fill:#eef2ff,stroke:#4f46e5,color:#1e1b4b,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef app fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#0f766e,color:#134e4a,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef data fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#ea580c,color:#7c2d12,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef external fill:#fdf2f8,stroke:#db2777,color:#831843,stroke-width:1.5px

  subgraph Client[使用者入口]
    Desktop[桌面端浏览器]:::client
    Mobile[移动端浏览器]:::client
    Admin[管理后台]:::client
  end

  subgraph App[校墙应用]
    Static[静态页面<br/>frontend / public 镜像]:::app
    Server[Express 服务]:::app
    Routes[路由与认证中间件]:::app
    Services[业务服务<br/>媒体、邮件、通知、草稿]:::app
    Jobs[定时清理任务]:::app
  end

  subgraph Data[数据与媒体]
    DB[(MySQL)]:::data
    Uploads[(运行时上传文件)]:::data
  end

  subgraph Integrations[可选集成]
    Mail[SMTP 邮件]:::external
    AI[AI 服务]:::external
    Official[微信公众号接口]:::external
    Video[ffmpeg / ffprobe]:::external
  end

  Desktop --> Static
  Mobile --> Static
  Admin --> Static
  Static --> Server --> Routes --> Services
  Routes --> DB
  Services --> DB
  Services --> Uploads
  Jobs --> Uploads
  Jobs --> DB
  Services -. 可选 .-> Mail
  Services -. 可选 .-> AI
  Services -. 可选 .-> Official
  Services -. 可选 .-> Video
